title KEYBOARD view, JA 12-key flick pad: "kanji" flicked in, reading and candidates (ADR-024 FR-746)
view keyboard
caps off
unicode linux
lang_ja 1
ja 1
step tap_lang
step tap_flick_mode
step flick 1:0
step flick 10:2
step flick 2:1
step flick 9:0
